          "bodySize": 624,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 624,
            "text": "{\"title\":\"Morning Coffee\",\"lyrics\":\"[Verse]\\nSunlight on the kitchen tile\\nKettle whistling for a while\\nFirst breath of the day so slow\\nNowhere else I need to go\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nPour it slow\\nLet it flow\\nWake me up\\nFill my cup\\n\\n[Verse]\\nSteam is rising off the rim\\nMorning light is soft and dim\\nOne sip and I start to feel\\nEverything is turning real\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nPour it slow\\nLet it flow\\nWake me up\\nFill my cup\\n\\n[Verse]\\nBitter sweet and warm inside\\nNowhere left for me to hide\\nDay is breaking soft and new\\nAll I need is this and you\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nPour it slow\\nLet it flow\\nWake me up\\nFill my cup\\n\\n[Outro]\"}"
          },
